        "comments": "The assembly cbPolAlpi2.1 is based on 180x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, the primary assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 1 (15.80 Mbp - 16.28 Mbp), chromosome 2 (10.78 Mbp - 12.43 Mbp) and chromosome 4 (60.65 Mbp - 61.34 Mbp) are unknown.",
